    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like 'mistakes' though. it feels like im just a constant drain on everything. the money, the stress, the bad mood... they'd be so much better off if they didnt have to keep watching me struggle and fail every single day. it just feels like im holding them back from actually being happy.",
