      "content": "i know people say that but it doesnt change the reality. every single day i look at them and all i see is how much more they could have if i wasnt constantly dragging them down. it feels so selfish to keep dragging them through this life with me when i know i'm the reason things are so hard. like, why am i even forcing them to deal with me?",
